rhizome-graph (0.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging. The version is the one pyproject.toml declares, plus a
    Debian revision; packaging/build-deb.sh reads it from the line above, so
    this file is the single place a release bumps.
  * Carries a virtualenv holding websockets alone, because the daemon imports
    websockets.asyncio.server and the version Debian ships predates it.
  * Carries the built front end at /usr/lib/rhizome-graph/web, which is where
    rhizome_graph/assets.py looks for it on an installed system. It is
    gitignored build output, so it must be built before the package is.

 -- rhizome-graph contributors <brn.qi.home@gmail.com>  Sun, 16 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000
